00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.000
It's a shame.

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:54.166
the world is going to end tomorrow,

00:07:54.458 --> 00:07:56.375
and I don’t even know how it began.

00:07:56.375 --> 00:07:58.458
I heard that our world was made when

00:07:58.458 --> 00:08:01.041
the gods smashed two universes together.

00:08:01.041 --> 00:08:03.166
That’s why it doesn’t make much sense, you know?

00:08:04.416 --> 00:08:05.375
LeBron?

00:08:05.375 --> 00:08:06.500
What happened to you?

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.750
So? What do you think?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:09.375
Looks good.

00:08:09.375 --> 00:08:10.166
Finally.

00:08:10.625 --> 00:08:11.625
OK, phew!

00:08:11.625 --> 00:08:12.625
Because I just shaved off

00:08:12.625 --> 00:08:15.125
like forty thousand gold worth of hair potions.

00:08:16.375 --> 00:08:17.375
What in the seven hells?

00:08:17.708 --> 00:08:18.333
They're here.

00:08:23.375 --> 00:08:24.583
Halt!

00:08:24.583 --> 00:08:25.958
Ser Jordan!

00:08:25.958 --> 00:08:28.250
End this now before you embarrass yourself.

00:08:30.833 --> 00:08:31.958
Wait, what are you all doing here?

00:08:31.958 --> 00:08:32.958
It's not safe.

00:08:32.958 --> 00:08:34.083
It is now.

00:08:34.083 --> 00:08:36.416
For House Sunkings will defend the realm.

00:08:36.708 --> 00:08:37.583
What’s a Sun King?

00:08:37.583 --> 00:08:40.083
We are a newly formed superhouse comprised of the

00:08:40.083 --> 00:08:42.750
best knights from House Suns and House Kings.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.333
Alone, we wallow in eternal mediocrity.

00:08:45.333 --> 00:08:46.333
Maybe worse!

00:08:46.333 --> 00:08:47.333
But together,

00:08:47.333 --> 00:08:50.166
we stand toe-to-toe with anyone.

00:08:50.166 --> 00:08:52.208
You should leave now, before it’s too late.

00:08:52.208 --> 00:08:53.750
The Dream Team will be here any minute.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:54.750
Well then...

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:56.958
Sun Kings! Ready yourselves.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.875
Guys, guys. I can’t watch you get slaughtered.

00:08:59.875 --> 00:09:00.750
Let me join you.

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:01.958
We don’t need you.

00:09:01.958 --> 00:09:04.541
We have Deandre Ayton and uh...

00:09:04.541 --> 00:09:06.916
who is the guy we took over Luka?

00:09:06.916 --> 00:09:07.958
Jaren Jackson!

00:09:07.958 --> 00:09:08.958
Marvin Bagley.

00:09:08.958 --> 00:09:09.958
Marvin Bagley, yes!

00:09:10.666 --> 00:09:11.083
Ugh.

00:09:11.083 --> 00:09:14.541
Knuckleheads!

00:09:14.541 --> 00:09:15.833
Sun Kings!

00:09:15.833 --> 00:09:17.083
Flame your balls!

00:09:17.833 --> 00:09:18.541
What?

00:09:18.541 --> 00:09:19.750
I'm not gonna say it.

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:23.000
Sun Kings! ATTACK!

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:23.791
We don't need Luka!

00:09:23.791 --> 00:09:34.666
[Battle cries]

00:09:34.666 --> 00:09:41.583
[Battle cries fade]

00:09:42.916 --> 00:09:46.041
I don’t know anything about the Sun Kings,

00:09:46.041 --> 00:09:47.500
but the Sun Kings in trouble.

00:09:47.708 --> 00:09:48.500
Well,

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:50.291
