00:09:55.375 --> 00:09:55.916
Yes.

00:09:55.916 --> 00:09:59.000
I would absolutely take Jahlil Okafor over Ben Simmons.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:09:59.458
Um...

00:09:59.458 --> 00:10:01.041
Can we talk about how we're being 

00:10:01.041 --> 00:10:03.208
attacked by Russell Westbrook right now?

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:05.291
Block the lanes!

00:10:05.291 --> 00:10:07.208
Ha! Russ attacking the media?

00:10:07.208 --> 00:10:08.208
What else is new?

00:10:08.208 --> 00:10:10.125
Come on. He shoots twenty percent from the outside.

00:10:10.125 --> 00:10:11.333
I wouldn’t be too concerned.

00:10:11.333 --> 00:10:12.625
I don’t care about the numbers.

00:10:12.625 --> 00:10:14.708
I mean, he's got that killer instinct.

00:10:14.708 --> 00:10:15.583
I want him taking the fi—

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.291
I told you!

00:10:19.458 --> 00:10:21.000
The Swamp Dragon...

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:22.125
It lives.

00:10:22.125 --> 00:10:24.500
IT LIVES!

00:10:25.541 --> 00:10:28.250
Alright, I have a little pump-up speech I prepared.

00:10:32.625 --> 00:10:33.041
You know?

00:10:33.041 --> 00:10:35.375
Actually, guys, I would be selling you all short

00:10:35.375 --> 00:10:36.875
if I read from this shit.

00:10:36.875 --> 00:10:39.375
So I'm gonna go straight from the heart.

00:10:41.125 --> 00:10:43.500
If you’re to believe the old heads,

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.500
our enemy hails 

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:47.083
from an era far superior to our own.

00:10:47.833 --> 00:10:50.083
They are slayers of giants,

00:10:50.083 --> 00:10:51.833
ogres and dragons.

00:10:52.416 --> 00:10:54.000
Untouchable.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.000
Immortal!

00:10:55.833 --> 00:10:58.166
They are the gods of this game.

00:10:58.166 --> 00:10:59.333
And we should just 

00:10:59.333 --> 00:11:02.250
get on our knees and thank them

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:04.708
for the right to live in their shadow.

00:11:05.541 --> 00:11:08.750
But against the hollow ghosts of the past,

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:13.000
the future is the eternal underdog.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:13.833
Today,

00:11:13.833 --> 00:11:16.833
we fight with the wind at our backs.

00:11:16.833 --> 00:11:18.833
And those gusts howl

00:11:18.833 --> 00:11:20.333
with the cries of

00:11:20.333 --> 00:11:23.958
legendary knights, yet unborn.

00:11:23.958 --> 00:11:25.916
Now I could go on,

00:11:25.916 --> 00:11:26.916
but our generation 

00:11:26.916 --> 00:11:29.625
doesn’t have the attention span for that.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.833
So let’s go out there,

00:11:31.833 --> 00:11:33.458
and show them

00:11:33.458 --> 00:11:36.166
what efficient basketball looks like!

00:11:36.958 --> 00:11:39.458
MY FELLOW GODS OF TOMORROW,

00:11:39.458 --> 00:11:40.541
WE ARE 

00:11:40.541 --> 00:11:42.000
THE DREAM TEAM’S 

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:44.791
NIGHTMARE!

